-------------------------------------------------------------------
Sun Sep 27 19:52:55 UTC 2026 - Fridrich Strba <fstrba@suse.com>

- Upgrade to upstream version 3.5.0
  * Removed
    + Commandline and Shell no longer implement Cloneable. Their
      clone() methods always threw, so only code that references
      them is affected
  * Deprecated
    + StringUtils.replace and StringUtils.contains
    + The logging package, in favour of MessageBuilderFactory
    + StringUtils.concatenate, in favour of String.join
    + StringUtils.clean(), in favour of StringUtils.trim()
    + PathTool
    + StringUtils.split
    + The remaining shared XML classes, including Xpp3Dom
      (MSHARED-1274)
    + Add missing @Deprecated annotations
    + FileUtils.forceMkdir and contentEquals, which Commons IO
      provides (MSHARED-1271)
    + Os, unmaintained for over a decade (MSHARED-1215)
    + FileUtils.copyFile and FilterWrapper, in favour of
      org.apache.maven.shared.filtering (MSHARED-1260)
    + WriterFactory (MSHARED-1254) and ReaderFactory (MSHARED-1253)
  * Bug fixes
    + Process handling:
      ~ Close process streams after exit, to work around the
        JDK-4311711 hang
      ~ CommandLineUtils: wait on every pumper in a try/finally
      ~ AbstractStreamHandler.setDone: call notifyAll to wake
        waiting threads
      ~ StreamPollFeeder: declare done and exception as volatile
      ~ Pass streamCharset to the stdout and stderr pumpers
      ~ CmdShell: quote items that cmd.exe would otherwise interpret
    + XML:
      ~ Xpp3DomBuilder.createXmlReader: stop changing system
        properties, which was not thread-safe
      ~ Xpp3Dom.removeChild(int): fix childMap corruption with
        duplicate names
      ~ Xpp3Dom.getValue(): honour the @NonNull contract
      ~ Xpp3DomWriter: reject a null DOM with a named
        NullPointerException
      ~ PrettyPrintXMLWriter: handle a null lineIndent in the
        constructors
    + Strings, paths and files:
      ~ StringUtils.chompLast: fix StringIndexOutOfBoundsException
        when the separator is longer than the string
      ~ StringUtils.chopNewline(""): fix
        StringIndexOutOfBoundsException
      ~ StringUtils.leftPad and rightPad: handle an empty delimiter
        without ArithmeticException
      ~ PathTool.getRelativeFilePath: fix the Windows drive-letter
        regex
      ~ Os.getOsFamily: return an empty string instead of null
      ~ Copy a symbolic link even when its target does not exist
  * Documentation
    + Port the site from APT to Markdown
    + Rewrite the documentation in ASD-STE100 Simplified Technical
      English
    + Correct the class names that deprecation notes point at
    + Stop naming individual Windows versions in the CmdShell docs
    + Fix site page issues
    + Correct the StringUtils.abbreviate() Javadoc
  * Maintenance
    + rop the nullness annotations: jsr305 was replaced by JSpecify
    + Remove the last dependency on Plexus, which was test-scoped
    + Remove unreachable escaping logic and unused code
    + Clean up API docs and exceptions (MSHARED-1273)
    + Code modernisation: StringBuilder for locals, empty arrays in
      toArray, cached system properties, diamond operator
      (MNG-6847), stale warning suppressions
  * Tests
    + Migrate the tests to JUnit 5
    + Fix varargs warnings in StringUtilsTest
    + Use precise assertions, show Unicode unescaped on failure, and
      test exceptions properly
  * Build and infrastructure
    + Remove plugin downgrades for bugs that have since been fixed
      (MSHARED-1112)
    + Enable GitHub Issues
    + Enable branch protection rules
    + Add a tag template to the release-drafter configuration
  * Dependency updates
    + Runtime:
      ~ commons-io 2.11.0 -> 2.22.0 (MSHARED-1363)
      ~ jansi 2.4.0 -> 2.4.3
    + Build and test:
      ~ Parent maven-shared-components 39 -> 49
      ~ maven-assembly-plugin 3.6.0 -> 3.8.0 and
        maven-resources-plugin 3.3.1 -> 3.5.0
      ~ apache/maven-gh-actions-shared workflows v3 -> v5
      ~ hamcrest 2.2 -> 3.0, commons-text 1.10.0 -> 1.11.0, jspecify
        1.0.0 -> 1.0.1
      ~ Fix the hamcrest dependencies (MSHARED-1255)
- Removed patch:
  * 0001-Restore-compatibility-with-current-maven.patch
    + not needed with this version

